## What is `ace-server`?

`ace-server` is the ArkTS/ArkUI language server that Huawei ships inside
DevEco Studio. It is a bundled Node.js application (not Java), located at
`plugins/openharmony/ace-server/` in a DevEco Studio installation. It is
Huawei proprietary code.

This project does **not** re-implement it and does **not** claim any rights
over it. The extractor merely copies that directory out of a DevEco Studio
installation that the user already has, so it can be run without the full IDE.
Release artifacts that contain `ace-server` are derivative redistributions of
Huawei software and remain subject to Huawei's terms; they are provided on a
best-effort basis for interoperability only. Users are responsible for
ensuring they have the right to use DevEco Studio and the HarmonyOS SDK.

